{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avery Stardust, an enigmatic automaton, is trapped in the mysterious Global Psychometric Assessment Program with a chilling sentence: death in 17 days unless He can recall his reset code, A 6 letter code is all that stands between life and death.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/STDesc.jpg?t=1750692324\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>17 Days in Prison</strong>: Experience the mysteries of the SYNCO PATH program as a highly advanced machine with an overactive imagination. Traverse a maze of technological and industrial nightmares in a quest to uncover the truth hidden within your own memories. What could be more terrifying than being alone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/S_P_GIF7.gif?t=1750692324\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reject Determined Destiny: </strong>From your prison cell, dive into a world gripped by the algorithmic control of the globe spanning Stagnation Protocol. What does it mean to secure a future and what must one do to determine their own destiny?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/S_P_GIF5.gif?t=1750692324\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Prove yourself of sound mind: </strong>Dream, draw, and use your wits and tools to unravel the complex mystery that lies at the root of your occupancy. In this austere prison only one code 